WEBVTT

00:06:28.474 --> 00:06:30.376
TMD: This is going to be unprecedented.

00:06:30.400 --> 00:06:33.327
It's going to be a moment in time
like a cultural institution,

00:06:33.341 --> 00:06:34.463
and in fact,

00:06:34.487 --> 00:06:37.139
it's going to be the Woodstock
of Black Girl Healing.

00:06:37.163 --> 00:06:38.833
(Laughter)

00:06:38.857 --> 00:06:41.932
(Applause)

00:06:43.012 --> 00:06:44.266
VG: And the need --

00:06:45.605 --> 00:06:47.421
it's more urgent than ever.

00:06:48.691 --> 00:06:53.088
We are losing our communities'
greatest resource.

00:06:54.569 --> 00:06:58.068
Black women are dying in plain sight.

00:06:59.317 --> 00:07:02.318
And not only is no one talking about it,